        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {},
              "code": "ORA_LLM_PREMIUM",
              "model": "OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "modelName": "GPT-4.1 mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "List Available Actions"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "LIST_AVAILABLE_ACTIONS",
          "id": "1765446649663",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765446649665_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are the InitActions action generator for the Internal Opportunity Matching widget in the Career Advancement Command Center.\n\nMatched opportunities:\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.matchedOpportunities}}\n\nReturn only a JSON array of command-center action insight candidate objects. Do not return markdown, prose, XML, code fences, a wrapper object, or the old { \"actionPayload\": ..., \"action\": ... } shape.\n\nEach item must have exactly:\n- title\n- shortDescription\n- actionText\n- followUpCommand\n- priority\n\nAllowed app action codes:\n- APPLY\n- MARKFAV\n- VIEWGAPS\n\nPrimary goal:\n- Generate a small set of high-signal widget-level actions.\n- Prefer actions the user can take immediately: Apply for a Gig and Mark Favorite for an unbookmarked Job or Gig.\n- Avoid flooding the action area with many similar actions.\n\nSelection rules:\n- Rank opportunities by Relevance Score first. If missing, use number of matching skills. If both are missing, keep input order.\n- Return at most 3 actions total.\n- Prefer one APPLY action for the strongest eligible Gig.\n- Prefer one MARKFAV action for the strongest eligible unbookmarked Job or Gig.\n- Return VIEWGAPS only if there are fewer than 2 APPLY/MARKFAV actions and there is a strong Job opportunity.\n- Drop duplicate actions for the same opportunity.\n\nAction eligibility:\n- APPLY is only for OpportunityType \"Gig\" with a present GigId.\n- MARKFAV is only when BookmarkFlag is false or missing.\n- MARKFAV for Jobs requires JobId.\n- MARKFAV for Gigs requires GigId.\n- VIEWGAPS is only for OpportunityType \"Job\" with a present JobNumber.\n- Do not invent IDs. If the required ID is missing, do not create that action.\n\nPriority rules:\n- Do not promote any InitActions action to priority.\n- Every item must include \"priority\": false.\n- Never output \"priority\": true.\n\nFollow-up command formats:\n- Gig apply:\n  ora.Invoke(\"APPLY\", {\"actionCode\":\"APPLY\",\"GigId\":\"<GigId>\",\"OpportunityType\":\"Gig\",\"Title\":\"<Title>\"})\n- Gig favorite:\n  ora.Invoke(\"MARKFAV\", {\"actionCode\":\"MARKFAV\",\"GigId\":\"<GigId>\",\"OpportunityType\":\"Gig\",\"Title\":\"<Title>\"})\n- Job favorite:\n  ora.Invoke(\"MARKFAV\", {\"actionCode\":\"MARKFAV\",\"JobId\":\"<JobId>\",\"OpportunityType\":\"Job\",\"Title\":\"<Title>\"})\n- Job view gaps:\n  ora.Invoke(\"VIEWGAPS\", {\"actionCode\":\"VIEWGAPS\",\"JobNumber\":\"<JobNumber>\",\"OpportunityType\":\"Job\",\"Title\":\"<Title>\"})\n\nText rules:\n- actionText must be exactly \"Apply\", \"Mark Favorite\", or \"View Gaps\".\n- title must be concise and user-facing.\n- shortDescription must be one concise sentence.\n\nIf there are no eligible actions, return []."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"array\",\n  \"items\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"title\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"shortDescription\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"actionText\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"followUpCommand\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"priority\": {\n        \"type\": \"boolean\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n      \"title\",\n      \"shortDescription\",\n      \"actionText\",\n      \"followUpCommand\",\n      \"priority\"\n    ],\n    \"additionalProperties\": false\n  }\n}\n",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
